33. Write FunctionalInterface which will return sum of 3 values.
    Consider the condition that the parameter can be null, in case null consider default value as 100.
    Use this lambda function in another function.

```

    // Create lambda interface
    @FunctionalInterface
    public interface TriFunction<A,B,C, R> {
        R apply(A a, B b, C c);
    }

    // Use lambdas in another function.
    public static Integer applyTriFunction(Integer a, Integer b, Integer c, 
                                           TriFunction<Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer> fun, 
                                           Function<Integer, Integer> defaultValueFun) {
        a = defaultValueFun.apply(a);
        b = defaultValueFun.apply(b);
        c = defaultValueFun.apply(c);

        return fun.apply(a, b, c);
    }

    // Use function
    applyTriFunction(10, 20 ,30, ((x,y,z) -> x + y + z), (x -> x == null ? 100 : x));

```
  
